  "recommendation": "Keep CYC0 composable with explicit weak edges, close/drain/owner composition, and an opt-in diagnostic census. Keep transparent collection and finalizer semantics rejected. Record conditional weak-key/ephemeron liveness as a separate Research subcapability only.",
  "stopCondition": "Consider a conditional-liveness primitive only if a bounded problem requires observable key identity or ephemeron semantics and the generation/ID, owner-scoped lease, or detached-value compositions change that requirement or fail under a post-drain census, deterministic cleanup, and no hidden foreign boundary. Until then keep the Research subcapability separate and do not add a collector, finalizer, self-weak constructor, or new syntax."
